# Drought's "Sacrifice a Swamp" is a land type in its text, which Magical Hack changes (CR 612.2): once its Swamp is Island,
# Bot2's Dark Ritual is refused on turn 2 with only a Swamp out (and {B} from a Mox Jet to pay with), and on turn 4, with an
# Island played beside the Swamp, the Ritual takes the Island and the Swamp stays. Bot1 pays the upkeep {W}{W} on turn 3.
